    "summary": "Spend 1 CP as the opponent's [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) begins, picking 1 friendly **SMOKE** unit. For the rest of the phase, an attack's target gets the **[Benefit of Cover](vsdata:core-rule/benefit-of-cover)** when it is:\n\n- that **SMOKE** unit\n- any unit the attacker cannot [fully see](vsdata:core-rule/visibility) because your **SMOKE** unit's models block its view\n\nLike any Stratagem, it can be used only [once in a phase](vsdata:core-rule/using-stratagems).",
